    {
      "id": "119951cd-f058-412e-bc48-a208eafb28c4",
      "title": "Observe a cena, escute a frase e ligue a estrutura a uma atualização simples do dia.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "c540b423-e9cc-4541-85e9-5aac3cd6a2e7",
          "textContent": "<p>Uma atualização simples do dia pode começar assim:</p><p><strong>Hoy he ordenado mi escritorio.</strong></p><p>Em português: Hoje eu arrumei a minha mesa.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/11a081b9eab2445e98e59f54d452d8a0_b01-hoy-he-ordenado-mi-escritorio.png?Expires=1794099556&Signature=WuLFibF86xZzMPqpVC2XfQVLE1ZcyJob-0TXxl~T9TG70PHuXdRC8J9DAioZN1r1rhdUUkNuGBF-mtYu5yPlT5h5DL3YCcuY-t6ITq38Xn0yalLv2KnhsvH2gtB-Y70vQrEadH7sRf2~yokl0ODKWQUivR25Nv~3Qq3U5HBYH8~s~rz~GWcZvtZyEOBMyhjE1XUngJqxHBuBMd-Y9adnwXnsUbOXmRLY5oLOOnQGGY-dB7V6QlWqoJPr~P42kLCRv5JqR2bicJ0UgGVN0LuX2LvEgmoN5n08a49N8N0l6MPRJwaKiEXONLYUSIccTBFh1Z5wWORmNG~JiTXMeqwtng__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/5d2cf03d6c2a42d998d474b29e61dac0_b01-hoy-he-ordenado-mi-escritorio.mp3?Expires=1794099556&Signature=vTnD8JtPLXvLPg4L6AldUMDr372~IwHOiPRqAIwBctQHuZBKxEhwR88nLNU8KKtkEgTNARW1W9lY4zTXfYbP8YYQd~KNCdX-UTyCp7GoQe7BExZg6oC9cdB2kEpn4tRPwLaYe3ciu15EFc2z7Op9D1BpuiwMKsqWmckZSPUI~T0z0uXc-PoPRenbpiSOdSvRnZrFMh7HonnhsP2K953~lMrVMYZsXB7YcACdAt~nUPtovLjEQnIJor-ydiuk9CJrWQ3FSQSifXtrqn-yD4QsRVqYPR2GxlvjqxEqE4PwpBVz6hfdZURat6Ao6ymqaVZ6x4autJZZdmE6DqOF5oWkVg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
